Hi all,

First time posting etc. I am very new to Nethack and ascii gaming as a
a whole so I tought I would share my opinion on what I can see is such a
hot topic among Nethack players. 

When I first found Nethack some months ago I favoured the tiled interface
because frankily the pure ascii interface was just baffling to me. However
in recent weeks as I have gotten into the game more I feel that the ascii
interface although sparse and at times confusing has a huge advantage over
any other display.

Very simply the ascii interface leaves the door open for imagination. Now
I know that might sound a bit bent but I much prefer to have a sparse
interface and let my mind do a lot of the work. Also I feel that the (what
some might call) lack of detail adds to the atmosphere of the whole
expreience.

Anyway that's my two cent for what its worth. I can understand a persons
desire for a more newbie friendly interface however speaking as someone
new to the game I know that given time and a little effort most players
will see the real beauty of the ascii display. 

(Sorry if that all sounds a bit shit)

